EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}You again, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The rain hasn't driven you back
home yet? Lucky for us!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Sei ancora tu, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}La pioggia non ti ha fatto venire
voglia di tornare a casa? Evvaiii!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aa! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Yine sen, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yağmur seni hâlâ eve kaçıramadı mı?
Bizim şansımıza!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}It's still cruddy out, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I feel like I'm gonna drown in all
this oozy mud, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Dışarısı hâlâ berbat, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bu cıvık çamurun içinde boğulacağım
gibi, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Ah, hola otra vez, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!
Disfruta de nuestros charcos.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Son los más chulos de por aquí!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hello, hello, hello again!
{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Rainy days are just the best!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}And me? Even better!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tiens ! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Qu'y a-t-il de mieux qu'un
jour de pluie, je te le demande !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Hi hi hi ! À part moi bien sûr !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merhaba, merhaba, yine merhaba!
{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Yağmurlu günler EN İYİSİ!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ben mi? Daha da iyiyim!

FR:
Encore toi, c'est du délire !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}On les reconnaît vite, les fans de
la pluie, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

TRANSLATION:
Hey, yine karşılaştık! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
Böyle sürekli karşılaşıyorsak sen
de yağmurlu gün delisisin demek!

ES:
Aunque la lluvia me favorece,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
¡prefiero los días soleados!
¡Tanta humedad no es buena!

IT:
Mannaggia, sono bagnata fradicia! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Uffa! Non voglio che tu mi veda
conciata così!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Dur! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Ne?! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Sen bu yağmurun hayranı değil misin, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Benim keyfimi kaçıracak laf etme!
Bu kadar suyun içinde kendimi evimde
hissediyorum, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
